BossNPC: The Trial Officer's homeland reveres gladiatorial combat and trials. She roams various lands in search of a more powerful Trialist. While staying in your world, she sensed your potential to overcome endless ordeals and emerge victorious. As a result, she currently keeps a very close eye on you.
PotionNPC: XiaoYou, the Elixir Brewer, is a little girl highly skilled in brewing potions. Due to her innate talents in alchemy and soul manipulation, she was escorted to your world. She now runs a humble potion-brewing business here.
MaterialNPC: Legend has it that the Astral Trader navigates a colossal galleon across the boundless sea of stars, voyaging between various worlds. Her primary trade involves gathering, acquiring, and selling various types of materials from all domains and through various channels.
BuildNPC: QiaoQiao is an Architect Scholar who left her homeland due to conflicting ideals. She firmly believes that cement and bricks are far more reliable than rusting gears and machinery. Consequently, she is more than willing to share her trusted building blocks with you.
NatureNPC: XiaoXiangYang, the Flower Picker, is a member of the Sunflower Clan from a world known as the Mirage Garden. A bright and cheerful little girl, she shares a profound bond with all flora and fauna. Gifted with the potential of a "Flower Picker," she can wield a special power to resist the local illusory pollution, helping her kin explore the world and blaze new trails.
OreNPC: The Trove Curator is an avid traveler who roams countless worlds and nations in pursuit of precious ores. She also has a keen eye for collecting trinkets and accessories. To her, gold shouldn't just sparkle; it must serve its purpose and be utilized to its absolute maximum value.
